		<RichText x="62" y="857" fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="32" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="normal" color="#ffffff" width="328" height="36" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="32" color="#ffffff">Wt/Ed: 100000/4000</p>
			</content>
			<filters>
				<DropShadowFilter angle="40" color="#ffe599" distance="16" alpha="0.75" quality="2" blurX="25" blurY="25"/>
			</filters>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="66" y="1104" width="439" height="78" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.7490196078431373">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">尖刺：受到重击攻击时可击飞，飞行的尖刺碰到刺猬<span color="#ffdfbf">失去5%</span><span>生命值并使其眩晕一小会。尖刺存在</span><span color="#ffdfbf">30s</span><span>后消失。<br/>大冰块：</span><span color="#99ffff">0.4冻</span><span>盾，击破后可进行战斗。<br/></span><span color="#ffdfbf">(仅大世界)</span><span>死亡后掉落一只</span><span color="#ffffbf">小小硬猬兽</span><span>。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="255" width="439" height="114" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">刺猬进行拱、转、落至多3段的攻击，依次造成<span color="#ffe599">40%,50%+30%+20%,70%</span><span>伤害。第三段攻击命中尖刺后</span><span color="#ffdfbf">失去5%</span><span>生命值同时不造成伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="479" width="421" height="85" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">刺猬从远处加速朝玩家处滚动，造成<span color="#ffe599">80%</span><span>伤害，一段距离后停下。命中尖刺后</span><span color="#ffdfbf">失去5%</span><span>生命值同时不造成伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="703" width="439" height="114" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">刺猬弹出身上的4枚<span textDecoration="underline">尖刺</span><span>，散步在场地中，其中3枚必定呈三角形落下并摆放在场地中央，1枚落在玩家处，均造成</span><span color="#ffe599">45%</span><span>伤害。刺猬受到尖刺伤害会短暂眩晕。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="927" width="438" height="114" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">刺猬翻身挑起，重重坠地，造成<span color="#ffe599">100%</span><span>伤害，场地上存在尖刺时，可连续起跳3次。命中尖刺后</span><span color="#ffdfbf">失去5%</span><span>生命值同时不造成伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
